## 3. 数据结构

### 用户设置 (UserSettings)
```javascript
{
  userId: string,

  sound: {
    bgmEnabled: boolean,
    bgmVolume: number,      // 0-100
    sfxEnabled: boolean,
    sfxVolume: number       // 0-100
  },

  gameplay: {
    hintEnabled: boolean,
    hintDelay: number,      // 毫秒
    autoReady: boolean,
    playTimeout: number     // 秒
  },

  visual: {
    cardBackStyle: string,
    cardTheme: string,
    animationEnabled: boolean,
    language: string
  }
}
```

